# Cursor Security Skills

This project provides 79 security skills for Cursor IDE.

## Installation
```bash
./install.sh --agent cursor
```

This copies skills to `.cursor/skills/` and writes rules to `.cursorrules`.

## Skill Loading
Load `skills/security-orchestrator/SKILL.md` for automatic routing to specialized skills based on user intent.

## Categories
- recon (OSINT, reconnaissance, dark web)
- web-pentest (OWASP, API security, WAF bypass)
- network-pentest (AD, cloud, container escape)
- exploit-dev (zero-day, fuzzing, kernel, crypto)
- reverse-engineering (Ghidra, IDA, radare2)
- ctf (challenges, writeups, training)
- post-exploitation (lateral movement, persistence)
- cloud-security (AI/MCP, code audit)
- hardware-iot (UART/JTAG, firmware, SDR)
